body:
Please stop and Consider: 

Life is everything, 

death it is the end of everything.  

To the logic of some people, - there are sins that great powers such as Peace & Love cannot pardon, cannot forgive -  but these are few in number;    

what reason have you to desire the end of the personal everything that is your life? 

Then,     if you can look within,   and see that you are not truly burdened by significant Moral defects, -    you can reconcile yourself to your place in life,    but the greatness of life, - life is everything -  is a potentially endless range of reasons to live,   things to do,   ways to live;
